  english:
    title: AB Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: AB-type fire extinguishers are suitable for both solid and liquid fires.
      They are effective against Class A and Class B fires. The extinguishing agent
      should be directed at the source of the flames to control surface spread.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f61f3ce734e044458a2f9237d8109a6, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "AB Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC"
    message: "AB tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri, kat\u0131 ve s\u0131v\u0131 yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda
      kullan\u0131labilir. Hem A s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 hem de B s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131
      yang\u0131nlara kar\u015F\u0131 etkilidir. M\xFCdahale s\u0131ras\u0131nda
      alevin kayna\u011F\u0131na odaklan\u0131lmal\u0131 ve y\xFCzey yay\u0131l\u0131m\u0131
      kontrol alt\u0131na al\u0131nmal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed5e393a414e00141b0099783fcd57df, type: 2}
